14	// DEVDESK-771: how renderKustomizations uses the gate. Everything here goes
15	// through RunKubeconform with a scripted runner and names no symbol of the gate
16	// itself, so these tests run (and fail) before kustomize_gate.go exists.
17	//
18	// The gate runs when kustomize is a native binary, the network is cut
19	// (allow_remote_bases off) and only then. It is asked about each overlay after
20	// scope.cut() and before kustomizeArgs. On a refusal kustomize is not launched
21	// and the finding is K8S-RENDER, HIGH, with no Repro:
22	//   - a reference that is not local: remoteBlockedHeadline, whose Message names
23	//     the file, the field and the reference, each as %q;
24	//   - an overlay that cannot be judged (closed whitelist, fails closed): the
25	//     title and the Steps of its own.
26	
27	const uncheckedTitle = "Overlay not built: its references could not be checked"
28	
29	var nativeKustomize = ToolSpec{Source: ToolSourceBinary, Binary: "kustomize"}
